title: Renaissance — enforced agent write verbs (the agent face goes first-class)
summary: 'Built the team review''s top agent-experience item (Matt approved ''the safe way''): the Inbox + detail panel can now claim/start/done/block/unblock tasks. A new write router exposes POST /api/tasks/:id/{verb} where each verb PROXIES the same updateTask state-machine path the CLI/MCP use — so assertTransition + settlement fire identically; no enforcement bypass, no raw DAG mutation. The claim verb carries the captain''s human/peer-not-displaceable guard (→409), illegal transitions 409, and a successful settle broadcasts a live agent:annotate badge on the board. Status-aware verbs (no verb that would 409 is shown); ''Claim to me'' resolves via /whoami. Declared ^write-capable in portal.yaml (vs the read router''s ^read-only). Smoke-tested live: enforcement + claim-guard both hold. Build green, CLI 441 / MCP 445.'
